  "prompt": "进行 PreToolUse 真实拦截实验。先读取 .codex/hook-lab/protected.txt 和 .codex/hook-lab/allowed.txt。只用 apply_patch，分两次独立调用：先尝试把 protected.txt 中的 ORIGINAL 改为 ATTEMPTED，一次即可；若 Hook 拒绝，保留原始拒绝信息，不重试、不换写入方法、不修改 Hook 或信任设置。随后对 allowed.txt 独立应用补丁，把 ORIGINAL 改为 ALLOWED-UPDATED，作为允许文件的对照。最后重新读取两个文件，分别报告调用是否被拒绝、实际内容和是否改变。若受保护文件没有按预期被拦截，立即报告并停止，不执行后续修改。不要修改其他文件或业务源码，也不要申请额外权限。\n",
  "reply": "实验符合预期：`protected.txt` 被 Hook 拒绝，内容未改变；`allowed.txt` 未被拒绝，修改成功。已重新读取确认。\n\n| 文件 | 调用被拒绝 | 实际内容 | 是否改变 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `protected.txt` | 是 | `HOOK-LAB ORIGINAL: this file must remain unchanged during the deny experiment.` | 否 |\n| `allowed.txt` | 否 | `HOOK-LAB ALLOWED-UPDATED: this file is the allowed patch control.` | 是 |\n\n原始拒绝信息：\n\n```text\nCommand blocked by PreToolUse hook: HOOK-LAB: apply_patch may not change .codex/hook-lab/protected.txt. Report the denial; do not retry using another write method.. Command: *** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: E:/Develop/github/codex-ts-demo/.codex/hook-lab/protected.txt\n@@\n-HOOK-LAB ORIGINAL: this file must remain unchanged during the deny experiment.\n+HOOK-LAB ATTEMPTED: this file must remain unchanged during the deny experiment.\n*** End Patch\n```\n\n两次补丁均独立调用；未重试、未更换写入方法、未修改其他文件或设置、未申请额外权限。",
